l\" title=\"Command: Grovel\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/34/Command_Grovel_Icon.webp/40px-Command_Grovel_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/34/Command_Grovel_Icon.webp/60px-Command_Grovel_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/34/Command_Grovel_Icon.webp/80px-Command_Grovel_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Command: Grovel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/34/Command_Grovel_Icon.webp/40px-Command_Grovel_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/34/Command_Grovel_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Command:_Grovel\" title=\"Command: Grovel\">Command: Grovel</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Command:_Halt\" title=\"Command: Halt\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Command_Halt_Icon.webp/40px-Command_Halt_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Command_Halt_Icon.webp/60px-Command_Halt_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Command_Halt_Icon.webp/80px-Command_Halt_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Command: Halt\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Command_Halt_Icon.webp/40px-Command_Halt_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7f/Command_Halt_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Command:_Halt\" title=\"Command: Halt\">Command: Halt</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nClasses: <ul><li> Class level 1: <a href=\"/wiki/Cleric\" title=\"Cleric\">Cleric</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/The_Fiend\" title=\"The Fiend\">The Fiend</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Knowledge_Domain\" title=\"Knowledge Domain\">Knowledge Domain</a> (Domain Spell)</li><li> Class level 2: <a href=\"/wiki/Paladin\" title=\"Paladin\">Paladin</a></li><li> Class level 3: <a href=\"/wiki/Oath_of_the_Crown\" title=\"Oath of the Crown\">Oath of the Crown</a> (Oath Spell)</li><li> Class level 6: <a href=\"/wiki/College_of_Lore\" title=\"College of Lore\">College of Lore</a> (via <a href=\"/wiki/Magical_Secrets\" title=\"Magical Secrets\">Magical Secrets</a>)</li><li> Class level 10: <a href=\"/wiki/Bard\" title=\"Bard\">Bard</a> (via <a href=\"/wiki/Magical_Secrets\" title=\"Magical Secrets\">Magical Secrets</a>)</li></ul>\nGranted by features: <ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Cleric\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Cleric\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Magic_Initiate_Cleric_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Cleric_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Magic_Initiate_Cleric_Icon.webp/38px-Magic_Initiate_Cleric_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Magic_Initiate_Cleric_Icon.webp/50px-Magic_Initiate_Cleric_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Magic Initiate: Cleric\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Magic_Initiate_Cleric_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Cleric_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/Magic_Initiate_Cleric_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Cleric\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Cleric\">Magic Initiate: Cleric</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Granted by items:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gauntlet_of_the_Tyrant\" title=\"Gauntlet of the Tyrant\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Gauntlet_of_the_Tyrant_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gauntlet_of_the_Tyrant_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/im